# Frozen 2026-11-09 from fio/pilot/ and fio/pilot-2/ (pilot_report.txt in each).
# Doubling ladder, 8x span, the same shape as nginx's (5k/10k/20k/40k), so
# level k sits at the same fraction of each workload's top rate. Topped at
# 36000 IOPS: the highest rate sustained untraced (p99 1.40 ms, 0 errors,
# Gate 1 pass at 4.79 % against the 5 % limit, a narrow margin). 40000 is past
# the knee (p99 6.1 ms, Gate 1 fail); the drive saturates near 41700 IOPS.
# Every rate divides by FIO_NUMJOBS. Changing any line means a new results
# directory: schema.json records the ladder.
LADDER="1:4500 2:9000 3:18000 4:36000"
FIO_NUMJOBS=4
FIO_IODEPTH=32
